    ('伯母', '伯母热情地招待了我们一家人。', 'bác gái', 'bó mǔ', '伯母热情地招待了我们一家人。', 'bác gái', 'bó mǔ', 'Bómǔ rèqíng de zhāodài le wǒmen yī jiā rén.', 'Dì gái chồng đã nhiệt tình tiếp đãi cả nhà chúng tôi.', 'https://ssmqppvkgffknfqdvpwg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/card-audio/templates/hsk6-co-ban/word-8750737e6d337ab5f55c27e3.mp3', 'https://ssmqppvkgffknfqdvpwg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/card-audio/templates/hsk6-co-ban/sentence-0300e587b2ad5334e65a5e9a.mp3'),
